maluos-gateway (0.5.0) resolute; urgency=medium

  * Phase 13 slice 1b, the overlay: `maluctl gateway expose --bind overlay`
    puts the node API on the estate's network only. The config keeps the word;
    the gateway resolves it to the host's overlay address (the node's or the
    desk's enrolment) at every bind, does not listen while there is none, and
    maluos-overlay reloads it when the interface comes up. G2's pairing recipe
    becomes `backend add gpu-1 https://gpu-1.internal:11435 --key ...`.

